{# BJJ Submission Template V3 - Jinja2 #}
{# Generates markdown from TEMPLATE.json with safety emphasis and auto-generated schema #}
{# A/B Testing: variant-a-show/variant-b-hide CSS classes #}

---
title: "{{name}} | BJJ Submission | BJJ Graph"
description: "{{description}}"
---

{# PostHog A/B Testing Metadata #}
<body data-content-type="submissions">

<!-- Schema Markup - Auto-generated from JSON -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Execute {{name}} in BJJ",
  "description": "Step-by-step guide for {{name}} with safety protocols.",
  "step": [
    {%- for step in execution_steps[:8] %}
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "{{step.action}}",
      "text": "{{step.description}}",
      "position": {{loop.index}}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ],
  "tool": ["BJJ Gi or No-Gi attire", "Training partner", "Mat space"],
  "totalTime": "PT5M"
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for qa in knowledge_assessment[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "{{qa.question}}",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{{qa.answer}}"
      }
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "description": "{{description}}",
  "url": "https://bjjgraph.org/Submissions/{{name.replace(' ', '-')}}",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "BJJ Graph",
    "url": "https://bjjgraph.org"
  }
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Submissions", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Submissions/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "{{name}}", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Submissions/{{name.replace(' ', '-')}}"}
  ]
}
</script>

{# Debug mode indicator #}
{% if debug_mode %}
<!--
  🐛 BJJ Graph A/B Testing Debug Mode (Submission)

  Content Type: submissions
  Section Count: 14
  Week Seed: {{ week_seed }}
  Visual Variant: {{ visual_elements }}

  Generated: {{ generation_timestamp }}
-->
{% endif %}

> ⚠️ **SAFETY**: {{name}} targets the {{target_area}}. Risk: {{safety_considerations.injury_risks[0].injury}}. Release immediately upon tap.

{# Flexbox wrapper for A/B testing #}
<main class="content-wrapper" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

{{overview}}

**Category**: {{submission_category}}
**Type**: {{submission_type}}
**Target Area**: {{target_area}}
**Starting Position**: [[{{starting_position}}]]
**Success Rates**: Beginner {{success_rates.beginner}}%, Intermediate {{success_rates.intermediate}}%, Advanced {{success_rates.advanced}}%

</section>

<section id="safety-considerations" class="content-section">

## Safety Guide

**Injury Risks**:

| Injury | Severity | Recovery Time |
|--------|----------|---------------|
{% for risk in safety_considerations.injury_risks -%}
| {{risk.injury}} | {{risk.severity}} | {{risk.recovery_time}} |
{% endfor %}

**Application Speed**: {{safety_considerations.application_speed}}

**Tap Signals**:
{% for signal in safety_considerations.tap_signals -%}
- {{signal}}
{% endfor %}

**Release Protocol**:
{% for step in safety_considerations.release_protocol -%}
{{loop.index}}. {{step}}
{% endfor %}

**Training Restrictions**:
{% for restriction in safety_considerations.training_restrictions -%}
- {{restriction}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="key-principles" class="content-section">

## Key Principles
{% for principle in key_principles -%}
- {{principle}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="setup-requirements" class="content-section">

## Prerequisites
{% for req in setup_requirements -%}
- {{req}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="execution-steps" class="content-section">

## Execution Steps
{% for step in execution_steps -%}
{{step.step_number}}. **{{step.action}}**: {{step.description}}{% if step.timing %} (Timing: {{step.timing}}){% endif %}{% if step.pressure_level %} [Pressure: {{step.pressure_level}}]{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="opponent-defense-patterns" class="content-section">

## Opponent Defenses
{% for defense in opponent_defense_patterns -%}
- **{{defense.defense}}** (Effectiveness: {{defense.effectiveness}}){% if defense.your_adjustment %} - Your Adjustment: {{defense.your_adjustment}}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="common-mistakes" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Common Mistakes
{% for error in common_errors -%}
- **Mistake**: {{error.error}}{% if error.danger_level %} [{{error.danger_level}} DANGER]{% endif %}
  - **Consequence**: {{error.consequence}}
  - **Correction**: {{error.correction}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="variations-and-setups" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Variations
{% for variant in variations_and_setups -%}
**{{variant.variation_name}}**: {{variant.description}}{% if variant.when_to_use %} (When to use: {{variant.when_to_use}}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="knowledge-assessment" class="content-section">

## Test Your Knowledge
{% for qa in knowledge_assessment -%}
**Q{{loop.index}}**: {{qa.question}}{% if qa.safety_critical %} **[SAFETY-CRITICAL]**{% endif %}
**A**: {{qa.answer}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="training-progressions-and-safety-protocols" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Training Progressions
{% for phase in training_progressions_and_safety_protocols -%}
**{{phase.phase}}** ({{phase.timeframe}})
- Focus: {{phase.focus}}
- Resistance: {{phase.resistance_level}}
- Safety: {{phase.safety_emphasis}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="from-positions" class="content-section">

## From Which Positions?

{% for position in from_positions -%}
- [[{{position}}]]
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="related-submissions" class="content-section">

## Related Submissions

{% for submission in related_submissions -%}
- [[{{submission}}]]
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="related-content" class="content-section">

## Additional Related Content

{% for item in related_content -%}
- [[{{item.name}}]] - {{item.relationship}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="terminal-state" class="content-section">

## Match Outcome

Successful execution of {{name}} leads to → [[game-over|Game Over]]

*All submissions in BJJ ultimately converge to the same terminal state: the match ends when your opponent taps.*

</section>

</main>
